ext\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Elle <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> ne</span>  s'appelle <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> pas</span> Jeanne.<br/>  Vous<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> ne</span>  vous appelez <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> pas</span> Laurent. <br/></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"compl\u00e9ter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tu<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> ne</span> compl\u00e8tes <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> pas</span> le formulaire.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Nous<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> ne</span> compl\u00e9tons <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> pas</span> notre travail.</span><br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Lorsque<span class=\"strong\"> ne</span>  se trouve devant un verbe qui commence par une <span class=\"strong\">voyelle</span> ou un <span class=\"strong\">h</span> muet, il devient <span class=\"strong\">n'</span>.</br>Par exemple : <span class=\"italic\">Il <span class=\"strong\">n'</span>aime pas le chocolat</span>, <span class=\"italic\">je <span class=\"strong\">n'</span>habite pas ici.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le pr\u00e9nom ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le nom pr\u00e9c\u00e9dant le nom de famille", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Dans Marie Leblanc, \"Marie\" est le pr\u00e9nom.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le formulaire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un questionnaire qui contient de l'information personnelle", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Compl\u00e9tez le formulaire, s'il vous pla\u00eet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob03aud02", "type": "